  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.9.0 freezes the managed Icod.DCurses contract intended for direct 1.0 release closure. The stable contract is machine-guarded by a public API fingerprint of 43 exported types and 309 canonical contract lines; enum values, geometry, Unicode/cell semantics, lifetime, ownership, exception/cancellation behavior, nullable metadata, and the approved Terminal/TermInfo dependency boundary are deliberately reviewed and frozen. No public breaking cleanup was accepted relative to 0.8.0, so existing 0.8 source consumers have no planned migration. Package and conceptual documentation are synchronized with the published 0.8.0 predecessor, release-note dependency versions are derived from project PackageReference metadata, and representative editor, pager, Unicode, rich-input, lifecycle, ownership, failure-recovery, pad, large-screen, high-frequency, no-op, top, slabtop, and watch acceptance remains in the release gate. Dependencies remain Icod.Terminal 1.4.0 and Icod.TermInfo 1.10.0.",
